#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK provides some tools for converting between OpenQASM representations of quantum programs, and the [QuantumCircuit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) class.\n"
msgstr "O Qiskit SDK fornece algumas ferramentas para converter entre representações OpenQASM de programas quânticos e a classe [QuantumCircuit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qasm2-import\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"qasm2-import\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import an OpenQASM 2 program into Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-into-qiskit}"
msgstr "Importar um programa OpenQASM 2 para o Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-into-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two functions import OpenQASM 2 programs into Qiskit.\n"
"These are [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), which takes a filename, and [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), which takes the OpenQASM 2 program as a string.\n"
msgstr ""
"Duas funções importam programas OpenQASM 2 para o Qiskit.\n"
"São elas: [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), que recebe um nome de arquivo, e [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), que recebe o programa OpenQASM 2 como uma string.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Consulte a [API OpenQASM 2 do Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) para mais informações.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import simple programs {#import-simple-programs}"
msgstr "Importar programas simples {#import-simple-programs}"

